Unfortunately, we have chosen the “wrong” direction for our arrow here. In Definitions <a href="/tag/0ADG" data-tag="0ADG">74.22.1</a> and <a href="/tag/0ADI" data-tag="0ADI">74.22.3</a> we should have the opposite direction to what was done in Definition <a href="/tag/04W3" data-tag="04W3">74.3.1</a> by the general principle that “functions” and “spaces” are dual.